# Terraform working-directory artifacts (see projects/api_platform/infra/terraform/).
# .terraform.lock.hcl is deliberately NOT listed here: it pins exact provider
# versions/hashes so `terraform init` is reproducible across machines and CI,
# which is normal, recommended Terraform practice -- unlike .terraform/ (a
# regenerable local plugin cache) and *.tfstate (can contain sensitive values,
# and since this milestone never applies, would only ever hold stale/empty
# state if committed).
**/.terraform/
*.tfstate
*.tfstate.*
crash.log
crash.*.log
override.tf
override.tf.json
*_override.tf
*_override.tf.json
